# Clandestine Meddler: "When this creature enters, suspect up to one other target creature you control." (CR 115.1, 701.60a, 603.3d) Bot1 has two Memnites, Bot2 has one. Bot1 casts the Meddler on turn 3:
# the trigger may not target the Meddler itself ("other") or Bot2's Memnite, and "up to one" refuses a second target, but one of Bot1's Memnites is a legal target and becomes suspected (menace, can't block); the Meddler is not.

